Z||000041||Eric||01-15-2000||09:58 AM||||I'm up for whatever you guys decide.  The Mid Ohio thing sounds really cool.  I've always wanted to run around that track.  I always imagined myself turning a few hot laps in an Indy car, but I guess a parade lap or two in a Fiero would still be great.  Of course, I might just start daydreaming while I'm out there and cause some trouble with a few vettes.  Better take my "special" pills before I get in the car. ||||reg||1
Z||000042||Eric||01-15-2000||10:19 AM||||Hey la9, the autocross starts in early April, don't know what day yet.  I 'll tell everyone when they send me a schedule.  Last year it was at the Delphi plant for the majority of the season, so the trip for you shouldn't be much longer than my trip (roughly one hour drive).  All the events are on Sunday and the people there are really nice.  I was only able to go to the first race because my car decided not run anymore.  I hate it when it does that!  But it's going again and with any luck, I'll be able to run all the races this year.  Well, I hope some of you guys can make it.||||reg||7
