Z||000044||Scott2M4||01-18-2000||03:11 PM||||I'm going to propose three meetings.<P>#1 - For those interested (and able to make it on such short notice), I suggest we meet at Mom's in Red Lion this Sunday morning, January 23rd (bright and early - weather permitting).  After filling up our bellies, we can fill up the tanks and take the Fieros out to the Caesar's Creek Gorge (nice drive).<P>#2 - On a somewhat larger scale, I suggest we meet at the Cracker Barrel restaurant at the Middletown exit off of I-75 on Saturday, February 5th (again, bright and early - weather permitting).  From there, we can head out to Fort Ancient (nice drive plus lots of curvy roads).<P>#3 - On the largest scale, I'm thinking about a trip to Columbus to hook up with ChadMan, hefty, Eric, maybe 2M4 Dale, maybe others.  You guys can pick the place.<P>I just pulled these locations and dates out of my a$$.  Except for Saturday, January 22nd, I'm free over the next several weekends.  I'm very much open to other suggestions.<P>Let me know who's in ...<P>BTW, I promise not to point out any flaws on your cars if you promise not to point out the flaws on mine!      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
