Z||000052||Scott2M4||01-20-2000||03:06 PM||||Thought I'd throw this out ... just in case.<P>william_thorniii, fiero56 and I are meeting at <B>Fox and Hound</B> in Centerville for lunch on Sunday.  Pretty cool place - pool tables, dart boards, televisions (football playoff games!) and good food.<P>In case anyone else is interested (and is planning to be in the area on Sunday), F&H is located at 667 Lyons Road (off of SR725, which is off of both I-75 and I-675).  They open at 11 - we'll be there shortly thereafter.<P>It'll be a good time.  Come out if you can.||||reg||1
