Z||000055||Scott2M4||01-22-2000||11:49 AM||||Thought I'd post a map of the trip I'm proposing on 2/5:<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Feb5th.jpg"> <P>I ran the course this morning (to get mileage and time numbers).  It's about a 50-60 mile trip (took me about 1.5 hours).  The best part of the course (not reflected by my red ink) is the section between Waynesville and Lebanon.  The area is very scenic (not too many people out there), has lots of curvy roads, and takes us through Ft. Ancient Memorial Park.  I'd like to stop here if everyone else is game - and if it's open (they weren't this morning at 7:30    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">   ).<P>Again, my suggestion is to meet at Cracker Barrel for breakfast at 7AM.  From there, take 122 East to 741.  From there, we go clockwise (on the map).<P>Email me privately if you (a) are interested and/or (b) have comments/questions/concerns/suggestions.||||reg||1
