Z||000059||Scott2M4||01-24-2000||03:33 PM||||William:<P>Heuston Woods is a GREAT idea!  I love it out there - especially the mountain bike trails (remind me to start another topic about who carries their mountain bikes on their Fieros and how!).  Again, great idea.  Unless you want to, I'll organize it - as long as the 2/5 trip doesn't flop!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Speaking of the 2/5 trip ... sounds like we've got 4 so far (Drew, William, Bill and myself).  Any others?  Also, I called the park - got a machine.  Message said they re-open in March.  I'd still like to make the road trip but I'll leave it up to the rest of you.  We can still meet at CB and decide over breakfast.<P>Let me know ...||||reg||1
